  selectDefinedValue: ["Run readers in order. Return the first value other than undefined or null. The selector accepts false, zero and empty text. If no result qualifies, return the last value.\n\nWith no readers, return undefined despite generic T. If a reader throws an error, the selector throws that error. Readers after selection do not execute.", 'selectDefinedValue(() => null, () => 0, () => 1); // 0'],
