  TestEvidencePolicy: ['Explicit evidence selections for pass, fail and error outcomes. Each required array may be empty, has at most 128 unique local IDs, and refers to provider evidence types. The SDK declares no default evidence list.', 'const evidence: TestEvidencePolicy = {onPass:[],onFail:[],onError:[]};'],
