  TestProviderExecutionContext: ["Provider receives cancellation signal, mutable workspace root, log(stdout/stderr, text/bytes) and granted invoke with an optional call signal. Output logging is separate from ProviderResultV1. The local capability broker combines cancellation signals and returns failures. No unrestricted host access is part of the type.", "context.log('stdout', 'check started');"],
